---
import CommunityLayout from '../../layouts/CommunityLayout.astro';
---
<CommunityLayout title="相亲帖">
  <article data-view="detail" class="post-detail community-shell"><div class="community-main">
    <a href="/meet" class="community-back" data-astro-reload>返回相亲广场</a>
    <p id="community-message" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="community-message">正在加载帖子…</p>
    <div id="post-detail"></div>
    <div id="contact-section" hidden><h2>联系方式</h2><p id="post-contact"></p></div>
    <p class="community-note" id="report-post" hidden>遇到冒用或不当内容？<a href="mailto:hi@amazingindex.com">联系站点举报</a></p>
    </div><aside class="community-side"><section><h2>发帖人 / POSTER</h2><p id="post-author" class="community-note"></p></section><section><h2>照片 / PHOTO</h2><div id="post-photos"></div></section><section><h2>安全提示 / SAFETY</h2><div class="community-note community-aside-note"><ol><li>首次见面请选择公共场所，并告知朋友行程。</li><li>不转账，不借钱，不轻信投资推荐。</li><li>遇到不当内容，请联系站点举报。</li></ol></div></section></aside>
  </article>
</CommunityLayout>
